# CODEOWNERS — mechanical enforcement of the two-person ownership split
#
# @mayer-doa-coder = Tawhidul Hasan, @paraffinic0doomer = Md. Saif Ahmed Shejan
#
# This file exists so ownership is enforced by the platform rather than by memory.
# It is the single most effective anti-merge-conflict measure in the repo: if a PR
# requests review from BOTH owners, that PR is touching both halves and should
# almost certainly be split into two.
#
# Note: with only two people we do NOT require approvals to merge (that is a
# bottleneck, not a safeguard). CODEOWNERS is used here for notification and
# signal, not as a merge gate. See CONTRIBUTING.md.

